    affiliation: Newton Astro Labs
version: 1.2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tonynewton79-web/PHYSQED-v1.1"
url: "https://github.com/tonynewton79-web/PHYSQED-v1.1"
abstract: >-
  Experimental proof-carrying research software for finite exact claim
  contracts, constructive hypothesis-essentiality certificates, local
  mathematical-physics component checks, and scoped counterexample gates.
  The physics backends are research-stage and do not independently establish
  physical-law truth or general Einstein well-posedness.
keywords:
  - computational physics
  - exact arithmetic
  - mathematical verification
  - proof-carrying claims
  - generalized harmonic Einstein equations
